# Monorepo-root ignore for the liquidclips-marketing Vercel project.
# The project's rootDirectory is set to `liquidclips-marketing/`, so
# Vercel needs that subfolder + nothing else. Excluding every sibling
# keeps the upload under the 10MB CLI limit.
#
# Add new lines here when a new sibling folder is added to the monorepo.

# All sibling monorepo folders (NOT liquidclips-marketing, NOT account-app)
# 2026-07-08 · removed /account-app from excludes because the personal-team
# `account` Vercel project also deploys from monorepo root with rootDirectory
# set to account-app · the .vercelignore was stripping the source before
# build and producing empty Route(pages)-only bundles. Same pattern as the
# earlier liquidclips-marketing incident. Keep the marketing project happy
# by keeping every OTHER sibling in the excludes; account-app now uploads
# but its subfolder ignore rules handle its own node_modules.
/desktop
/desktop-2
/desktop-preview
/junior-backend
/partner-app
/python-sidecar
/marketing
/simulator
/assets-wip
/ai-projects
/dmg
/src
/ig-research
/statement-mockup

# Local caches + node_modules everywhere
node_modules
.next
.cache
.turbo
.DS_Store

# Docs / evidence · not deployed
/docs
/scripts
/*.md
/*.pdf
/*.jpeg
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.webp

# Git / IDE
.git
.githooks
.vscode
.claude
.idea
